  unitName: Sky Angel Vanila
  unitId: 850005
  unitNumber: 8014
  description: Vanila's respite from death granted her new skills; holy powers which
    she imbued into her Mech. Known for her matchless grace and beauty in battle,
    she crusades for the people of Grand Gaia. Recently, she heard rumors of another
    mech pilot, a dark angel of sublime skill who singlehandedly did battle with
    the Gods. Intrigued, Vanila calls the Battle Maidens to arms once more.
  summonDesc: Among the clouds, none is my equal. <br>If you want my strength, <br>show
    me your spirit!
  fusionDesc: This power I possess... <br>We shall use it against the gods!
  evoDesc: The light burns brightly in me. I know what must be done now.
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
